{"id":"aba489b7551a80b3","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-perfect-tree.md","title":"ZFC Perfect Tree","display":"df-zfc-perfect-tree — ZFC Perfect Tree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-perfect-tree","aliases":["58-df-zfc-perfect-tree","58-df-zfc-tree8-perfect-tree"],"display":"df-zfc-perfect-tree — ZFC Perfect Tree","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-tree]]","[[58-df-zfc-tree8-pruned-tree]]","[[58-df-zfc-tree10-splitting-node]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-perfect-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-perfect-tree</span><span>58-df-zfc-tree8-perfect-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-perfect-tree — ZFC Perfect Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f06e57c5c0b1354d\" href=\"?note=f06e57c5c0b1354d\" title=\"58-df-tree\">58-df-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0c460759287fa783\" href=\"?note=0c460759287fa783\" title=\"58-df-zfc-tree8-pruned-tree\">58-df-zfc-tree8-pruned-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ecbf926ec18d5a6f\" href=\"?note=ecbf926ec18d5a6f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-tree10-splitting-node\">58-df-zfc-tree10-splitting-node</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> (binary tree, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f06e57c5c0b1354d\" href=\"?note=f06e57c5c0b1354d\" title=\"58-df-tree\">58-df-tree</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8PrunedTree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8PrunedTree}_S\\)</span> (pruned-tree predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0c460759287fa783\" href=\"?note=0c460759287fa783\" title=\"58-df-zfc-tree8-pruned-tree\">58-df-zfc-tree8-pruned-tree</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcTree8PrunedTree}_S(T)\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\exists t,u\\in T\\;(s\\subseteq t\\land s\\subseteq u\\land t\\perp u)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcTree8PrunedTree}_S(T)\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\exists t,u\\in T\\;(s\\subseteq t\\land s\\subseteq u\\land t\\perp u)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every node has two incompatible extensions, while the pruned-tree predicate supplies the tree and no-terminal-node conditions.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-tree8-perfect-tree</code> is merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"f06